# Plan scratch: the planner writes `<slug>-plan.md` here and /project:work
# deletes it when the cycle ends. Only that name matches — a suffixed one
# (`auth-plan-v2.md`) shows up as untracked and fails the clean-tree check.
.handoff/*-plan.md

